      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Employee Onboarding & Department Dispatcher\n**N8N-PRJ-03**\n\nReads `Status = Pending` rows, loops one by one, routes by Department, emails the welcome kit, then marks the row **Onboarded**.\n\n**Setup:** replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`, attach Google Sheets and Gmail OAuth2 credentials, set the HR admin email.",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b199360c-04d5-458d-94e5-4dba13f53985",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        336
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Trigger + Intake\nManual or daily 09:00. Filter `Status = Pending`.\n\nZero pending rows means zero items, so the workflow ends cleanly (BRD-004).",
        "height": 130,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d6504fde-cdfb-462a-b5fc-a833498b483f",
      "name": "Note: Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        272,
        1056
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Department routing\nTrims and lowercases Department.\n0 = Engineering, 1 = Sales, Fallback = Ops/HR (NFR-002).",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "478a1475-fbfd-4c0c-a1c8-288e8bc2e2ac",
      "name": "Note: Switch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        1008
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Dispatch + State sync\nUpdate runs only after Gmail succeeds (NFR-001). It matches by `Employee_ID` only, so no other rows are touched. Loops back to the batch node.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "82560388-8dad-4401-ba62-b41ff5daf84f",
      "name": "Note: Email + Update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        1008
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Done output\nSends ONE summary email (Execute Once) after the loop completes.",
        "height": 110,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "a33a2837-1dbb-413e-aa0b-4ad5528ca0ac",
      "name": "Note: Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
